// IUT-Food application icon - compiled into both executables so the
// Explorer, the taskbar and shortcuts show the brand mark.  The .ico
// sits beside this generated .rc in the build tree, so a plain
// filename works everywhere; rc.exe eats "\a" in an absolute backslash
// path as a bell escape (RC2135 file not found).
1 ICON "iut-food.ico"
